    "preamble": "Kowthavarapu Nammaiah vs The State Of Andhra Pradesh on 25 November, 2020 Author: Cheekati Manavendranath Roy Bench: Cheekati Manavendranath Roy The Hon'Ble Sri Justice Cheekati Manavendranath Roy Criminal Petition No.5386 Of 2020 Order:",
    "facts": "- This petition is filed under Section 482 of the Code of Criminal Procedure, 1973, seeking return of the property that was seized in Crime No.207 of 2020 by Station House Officer of Tenali I Town Police Station. 2. Heard learned counsel for the petitioner and the learned Additional Public Prosecutor for the State. 3. The petitioner is the sole accused in Crime No. 207 of 2020 of Tenali I Town Police Station.",
